               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_345e9e43">33.3x21.9</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_446d76de">In 2<rend xml:id="idm42" rend="sup">o</rend>; upright format consisting of two nested bifolios; title page (fol. 1r), music (fols. 1v–4r), blank page with staves (fol. 4v); in all 2 bifolios. Hand-ruled paper, 14 staves (9 mm; single rastrum used) in light brown ink and music in black ink; on fols. 2v–4r the top four and bottom four staves have not been employed. A clean copy with very few corrections and deletions. Transcript produced by a professional copyist or an experienced musical amateur.</physMedium>
